# The synthetic-15k corpus is GENERATE-ON-DEMAND, not committed: the
# materialized tree is ~15,603 files / ~39 MB. What is committed is the
# generator (generator/generate.mjs) plus the content-hashed identity
# (manifest.json). A run regenerates the corpus and verifies the produced
# bytes hash to manifest.json before any measurement, so a drift can never
# silently read as a perf improvement.
corpus/
.out/
